description: Shared DTOs between WebApi and Blazor client
globs: src/ForensicsAnalyzer.Contracts/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Contracts (`ForensicsAnalyzer.Contracts`)

- DTOs and request models only. No handlers, EF entities, or Blazor components.
- Keep API and Blazor in sync: changing a DTO is a cross-layer contract change — mention it in docs and the proposed commit message.
- Do not duplicate Domain entities here; map Entity → DTO in Infrastructure AutoMapper profiles.

```csharp
// ❌ BAD — entity leaked as API contract
public class CaseDto : Case { }

// ✅ GOOD — explicit DTO
public sealed class CaseDto { public Guid Id { get; set; } public string Name { get; set; } = string.Empty; }
```
